WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.107
Do you know where to find Bangladesh on a map?

2
00:00:03.108 --> 00:00:05.792
Most people have heard of it, but can't find it.

3
00:00:05.793 --> 00:00:09.299
We'll give you a hint: it is somewhere in Asia.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.255
Bangladesh is surrounded by India and a tiny part of Myanmar.

5
00:00:15.256 --> 00:00:18.995
It is a small country, but it is a strong country.

6
00:00:18.996 --> 00:00:22.615
For hundreds of years, Bengalis have lived through many wars. And

7
00:00:22.616 --> 00:00:29.072
every year from May to October, the country is flooded by the monsoons and overflowing rivers. But

8
00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:33.595
the Bengalis have survived. With

9
00:00:33.596 --> 00:00:38.038
the wars and the flooding, you might think the people are depressed. But

10
00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:39.930
they aren't. The

11
00:00:39.931 --> 00:00:46.128
Bengalis like to say, "We don't have much, but we are proud of what we do have." If

12
00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:51.601
you visit Bangladesh, you will see that this is very true. Everywhere

13
00:00:51.602 --> 00:00:57.582
you go in Bangladesh, the Bengalis show artistic pride in what they have. The

14
00:00:57.583 --> 00:01:01.419
women wear beautiful saris and salwar kameez .

15
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:09.939
It takes eight and a half meters of fabric to make a sari , and the women wrap it around and around to make a dress.

16
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:16.169
It does not take as much fabric to make a salwar kameez , and the women say it is easy to

17
00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:25.698
wear. Both the sari and the salwar kameez are made out of bright and beautiful fabrics that give a feeling of life and

18
00:01:25.699 --> 00:01:30.878
happiness. Believe it or not, the men actually wear skirts, called

19
00:01:30.879 --> 00:01:36.234
lungis . The lungi is made out of bright patterns and colors just like the

20
00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:46.300
women's clothes. And when they need to ride a bicycle or walk through deep water, they pull it up and tuck it in so that it looks

21
00:01:46.301 --> 00:01:50.144
like shorts. For some people, all they own are the clothes

22
00:01:50.145 --> 00:01:59.021
they wear. But like all Bengalis, they show great pride by making their clothes very

23
00:01:59.022 --> 00:02:02.097
colorful. Bengalis are also artistic when they

24
00:02:02.098 --> 00:02:06.900
travel. Because cars are so expensive, many Bengalis ride in

25
00:02:06.901 --> 00:02:12.511
rickshaws. A rickshaw is a bicycle with a cart behind it where one or two people ride

26
00:02:12.512 --> 00:02:19.449
inside. Of course, sometimes they can even squeeze three or four people

27
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.387
inside! Bengali rickshaw drivers are very proud of their

28
00:02:23.388 --> 00:02:29.825
rickshaws. Most rickshaws have been carefully decorated in bright colors on all

29
00:02:29.826 --> 00:02:39.182
sides. If you rode in a rickshaw, you would see paintings on the back of the cart or its cover, on the driver's seat, and decorations on the

30
00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:44.300
wheels. But, rickshaws aren't the only painted

31
00:02:44.301 --> 00:02:50.103
vehicles. Those people who can afford trucks show how thankful they are by making them look beautiful.

32
00:02:50.104 --> 00:02:54.887
For example, this truck has five different pictures on each side.

33
00:02:54.888 --> 00:03:00.569
And that truck has different colored stripes on the front!

34
00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:07.105
As you can see from our quick tour of Bangladesh, it is a very colorful country.

35
00:03:07.106 --> 00:03:15.922
And even though storms and battles may come, Bengalis still find a reason to be artistic and smile.

